  "details": "All im asking is to add a toggle that the Gravity only takes effect at a certain angle! Just how it used to be on Dynamic Bones. I attached two files to show what i mean.\nFor example a lot of my Avatars need gravity to be enabled at an certain angel which it doesn't anymore.\n\nIn the first GIF the bones just instantly flop down when Gravity is turned on. I tried using some curves to get around it, which made them stiff but at least stayed when standing straight. But didn't flop down as they should in the Second GIF.",
